{{!
    @template format_mnemo/preview

    The admin asset viewer's body: the textures gallery, the model cards grouped
    by category, and the "Save all" bar. The dynamic parts (cards, forms, headings)
    are built server-side with the page's helpers and passed in as pre-escaped HTML,
    so this template only lays out the page skeleton.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * pagetitle string The page heading (HTML).
    * rootid string The unique id of the root element (the client renders into it).
    * config string The JSON client config for the data-mnemo-preview attribute.
    * intro string The intro paragraph (HTML).
    * texturesheading string The "Textures" section heading (HTML).
    * texturecards string The texture cards (HTML).
    * modelsheading string The "Models" section heading (HTML).
    * axesnote string The axes note under the models heading (HTML).
    * modelsections array One entry per model category shown.
        * heading string The category heading (HTML).
        * help string The category help paragraph, or '' (HTML).
        * slotform string The category's slot-choices form, or '' (HTML).
        * cards string The category's model cards (HTML).
    * savebar string The "Save all" bar form (HTML).

    Example context (json):
    {
        "pagetitle": "<h2>Asset viewer</h2>",
        "rootid": "mnemo-preview-0",
        "config": "{}",
        "intro": "<p>Intro</p>",
        "texturesheading": "<h3>Textures</h3>",
        "texturecards": "",
        "modelsheading": "<h3>Models</h3>",
        "axesnote": "<p>Axes</p>",
        "modelsections": [
            {"heading": "<h4>Props</h4>", "help": "", "slotform": "", "cards": ""}
        ],
        "savebar": ""
    }
}}
{{{pagetitle}}}
<div class="format-mnemo-preview" id="{{rootid}}" data-mnemo-preview="{{config}}">
    {{{intro}}}
    {{{texturesheading}}}
    <div class="format-mnemo-preview__grid">
        {{{texturecards}}}
    </div>
    {{{modelsheading}}}
    {{{axesnote}}}
    {{#modelsections}}
        {{{heading}}}
        {{{help}}}
        {{{slotform}}}
        <div class="format-mnemo-preview__grid">
            {{{cards}}}
        </div>
    {{/modelsections}}
    {{{savebar}}}
</div>
